# Monorepo — shared ignore patterns for all agent projects

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/groq_key.txt
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Confidential / runtime data
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/resumes/*
!**/resumes/.gitkeep
!**/resumes/README.md

# Python
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/*.egg-info/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/frontend/dist/
**/frontend/.env*

# IDE / OS
.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.cursor/
**/*.log
